		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Our Final Podcast]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Ending its tenth full season of Fantasy Premier League content, the Always Cheating hosts sign on for one last episode. We discuss an eventful GW38 full of goals, red cards, blanks, triumphs, disasters, and . . . friends. The 2024/25 season was frequently challenging, giving us a lot the chew on as we reflect on our ranks and the goals we hit or missed throughout the year. And before we say goodbye, Josh and Brandon take a moment to consider the birth, life, and legacy of this channel. A sincere thanks to everyone who's joined us along the way. Poku Forever.</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pABvgunTgg4&t=132s" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pABvgunTgg4&t=132s</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating" target="_blank">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW38 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Our-Final-Podcast-e347aht</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">67095702-cd4a-42e7-abf4-21fa2ea47b5e</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 01:24:04 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097789/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121589-44100-2-1b57ff9021e86ad5.mp3" length="59620173" type="audio/mpeg"/>
