		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Our Fixture-by-Fixture GW38 FPL Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The 2024/25 Premier League's season's final fantasy deadline is upon us! While we watch and wait for the remaining GW37 fixtures to play out, join Josh and Brandon as we strategize for GW38. How can we be different? How can we be optimal? How can we go wild? We discuss fixture-by-fixture what the stakes are and what we expect to see on Championship Sunday. It's been another rollercoaster of an FPL season—thanks for joining us for some or all of it. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXGBkYe1-ps" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXGBkYe1-ps</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating" target="_blank">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW37 #GW38 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Our-Fixture-by-Fixture-GW38-FPL-Preview-e347a8h</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">2834c1ca-0ac3-4ce7-973b-ccb4c723dc0a</guid>
