		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Time to Say Goodbye & Our GW37 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Big news this week: After 10 remarkable years of producing weekly Fantasy Premier League content, the Cheaters are hanging up their boots. In this episode, we take a few minutes to explain our decision and to reflect on what our amazing community has achieved. But, even as we turn the page, there are two gameweeks still remaining to close the 2024/25 season. Join us as we catch up on the big moments from this weekend and look ahead to key transfers and captaincy options for a pivotal GW37. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/WGvAwXijpXs" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/live/WGvAwXijpXs</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating" target="_blank">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW36 #GW37 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Time-to-Say-Goodbye--Our-GW37-Preview-e347adb</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">54e81059-7d80-421d-b2f4-04390921199c</guid>
