		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Making the Most of the FPL Doubles in GW33]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Hail Cheaters! It's peak chip season with Triple Captains and Bench Boosts a plenty in GW32. But GW33 offers still more double game-week action with twice the action for Arsenal, Aston Villa, Crystal Palace, and Man City. So, what's the plan? Will Arsenal and Villa be distracted by the Champions League? Is there anyone on Man City we can trust to make two starting elevens? And what chips are left to capitalize on? We take it all in stride as we're hitting the season's home stretch. Join us! </p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/whLi2BxtJ6k" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/live/whLi2BxtJ6k</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating" target="_blank">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW32 #GW33 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p>
]]></description>
