		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The Late-Season "Pick a Player" FPL Game Show]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Hail Cheaters! In the middle of the final international break of the FPL season, and with more than a week still to go before GW30 kicks off, Josh and Brandon have decided to relieve the boredom with something new . . . the Late-Season "Pick a Player" Game Show. The rules are simple: We flip a coin to see who picks first and then the co-hosts run through all twenty Premier League clubs, alternating turns as we go, picking just one player from each team. The goal is to pick the player who we feel will score the most fantasy points from GW30 through the end of the season. That's it. Oh, and managers count, too. Here we go! </p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/90k4QSTyLX4" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/live/90k4QSTyLX4</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating" target="_blank">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW29 #GW30 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/The-Late-Season-Pick-a-Player-FPL-Game-Show-e347afp</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">10d96b08-a5d5-4557-858c-68bd9359d635</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 24 Mar 2025 02:31:40 GMT</pubDate>
