		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Josh's Free Hit & Best Strategies for FPL's GW29 Blank]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join Josh and Brandon as we recap the Premier League's ups and downs, highs and lows from this weekend. Major disappointment for Cole Palmer punters who can only watch in terror as Salah break's the single-season points record (that he already owned) . . . in March. But it's guaranteed that Salah will not factor in GW29 as Liverpool blank in favor of their League Cup final against Newcastle. Thusly, Newcastle also blank in GW29, as do Aston Villa and Crystal Palace. So, what strategies are best suited to getting through next weekend? Josh has committed to a Free Hit and takes us through his picks for the gameweek, while Brandon will use his stockpile of free transfers to move on some useless players. With that, we take a well-rounded view of what's to come, also weigh in on Manchester City's potential impact, and deliberate heavily on the optimal captaincy options. Hail Cheaters! </p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/-X2nc62-ZvM" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/live/-X2nc62-ZvM</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating" target="_blank">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW28 #GW29 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Joshs-Free-Hit--Best-Strategies-for-FPLs-GW29-Blank-e347adm</link>
