		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[GW28 FPL Preview & Preparing for GW29 Blanks]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join Josh and Brandon as we look ahead to GW28 and key FPL transfers and captain picks. The main talking point might be manufactured concern over Mo Salah's minutes against Southampton. Is that enough to scare us off the armband or even a Triple Captain chip? Plus, we recap the weekend's FA Cup results and consider what impact the quarterfinal draw will have on the fantasy calendar. A red card suspension for Cunha and head injury for Mateta complicate our thinking, too, with GW29 fixture blanks around the corner—many strategies are are still on the table, with or without a Free Hit. Hail Cheaters! </p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/UG0WfY3K-Dg">https://www.youtube.com/live/UG0WfY3K-Dg</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW28 #GW29 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
