		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Midweek Deadline Klaxon & Our GW14 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>It's a lightning fast turnaround for Tuesday's GW14 deadline. As is customary, set your Bus Team and then join hosts Josh and Brandon as we break down the GW13 highs and lows and apply our learnings to the FPL season's first midweek slate of fixtures. Saka is on fire, Palmer is heating up again, Salah continues to boil, and Bruno is about to have his say. But who gets the armband—and who makes way when we look to mix up the template? Plus, we run through our "concern index" for a handful of other crucial fantasy assets, deciding who to sell, bench, or buy. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/hSzKCNeWsKs">https://www.youtube.com/live/hSzKCNeWsKs</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW13 #GW14 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
