		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Battle of the FPL Budget Picks & Our GW13 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join hosts Josh and Brandon as we break down the GW12 highs and lows and look ahead to key decisions for the upcoming GW13. While Haaland and Palmer continue their run of blanks, this weekend was a fantasy masterclass by their premium counterparts: Salah and Saka. Has Saka become our biggest priority for the festive run? But GW12 wasn't just about expensive guys; budget picks in Cunha, Nicolas Jackson, and João Pedro all went supernova, giving FPL managers more options to shake things up. Next weekend's clash of Liverpool hosting Man City presents some tricky captaincy and benching decisions—or does it? Arsenal's visit to the London Stadium provides an enticing alternative. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/N9ucnjvJBDQ">https://www.youtube.com/live/N9ucnjvJBDQ</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW12 #GW13 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
