		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Haaland Fire Sale, Remarkable Wood, Solanke's Surge, and Our GW11 FPL Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join hosts Josh and Brandon as we break down the GW10 highs and lows and look ahead to key decisions for the upcoming GW11. Salah rewarded the FPL faithful with a classic goal versus Brighton—standard service has either resumed or it never went away. Meanwhile, against Bournemouth, Haaland again disappointed. As we audition our preferred three premium (three-mium) assets, this feels like THE critical moment for the Norwegian. Stick, twist, or gloat for not having had him for weeks? And no longer a passing fad, Chris Wood continues his dominant run, surpassing even every Arsenal asset in total fantasy points. Finally, we look ahead to the last gameweek before another international break and discuss if Solanke and Spurs are for real this time. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/8H6OvBLwkJw">https://www.youtube.com/live/8H6OvBLwkJw</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW10 #GW11 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Haaland-Fire-Sale--Remarkable-Wood--Solankes-Surge--and-Our-GW11-FPL-Preview-e347a6f</link>
