		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[International Break Update & Our FPL GW8 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join Josh and Brandon as we catch up International Break news including fitness and minutes played for key Fantasy Premier League assets. Who played? Who faked an injury or who had a real one? And what's the outlook for the upcoming GW8? We dig into which areas of our FPL teams need tweaking and where the hidden strengths might appear as Arsenal and Chelsea hit a tricky run of fixtures and Manchester City see nothing by green. "Stick or twist" is the question on every manager's mind. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW8 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
