		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The Big FPL Fixture Swing & Our GW6 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join hosts Josh and Brandon as we break down the Premier League and fantasy results from this weekend's GW5. After a feisty match between Man City and Arsenal, Haaland continues to pull away from the rest of the herd. Can Salah catch up—in our FPL estimation—despite is apparent lack of concentration and goals? GW6 also marks a big fixture turn for the Gunners and an opportunity for wildcarders to shuffle the pack. Which picks are in, out, and on hold? Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gWdfnzoDSZo">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gWdfnzoDSZo</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>$500 GIFT CARD GIVEAWAY! Complete this audience survey and help us give you a better advertising experience: <a href="http://bluewirepods.com/survey">http://bluewirepods.com/survey</a> Our network partner Blue Wire is giving away two (2) $500 gift cards for participating. For a chance to win, you must complete the entire survey, including entering your name and email so we can get in contact with you. All responses and data will be de-identified. You will not be added to any mailing lists as a result of taking this survey. By taking this survey you agree to Blue Wire's Terms of Service: <a href="https://www.bluewirepods.com/bw-terms-of-service">https://www.bluewirepods.com/bw-terms-of-service</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW5 #GW6 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
