		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Josh's Wildcard Passes the Point of No Returns Plus Our GW5 FPL Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join hosts Josh and Brandon as we break down the Premier League and fantasy results from this weekend's GW4. Did the typical post–International Break malaise wreak havoc on FPL? It did indeed, and Josh's wildcard squad struggled with unexpected blanks and mysterious injuries. What were our takeaways from Salah's unusually poor match against Nottingham Forrest, as well as from a resolute Arsenal in the North London Derby? And is Haaland breaking the game yet again? Plus we look ahead to a bevy of midweek Champions League and EFL Cup matches that could make GW5 planning a real headache. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/PV0vRLn_cRk">https://www.youtube.com/live/PV0vRLn_cRk</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>Win at FPL! Join Fantasy Football Hub this season with 50% off your membership at any tier using this link: <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always">https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p>$500 GIFT CARD GIVEAWAY! Complete this audience survey and help us give you a better advertising experience: <a href="http://bluewirepods.com/survey">http://bluewirepods.com/survey</a> Our network partner Blue Wire is giving away two (2) $500 gift cards for participating. For a chance to win, you must complete the entire survey, including entering your name and email so we can get in contact with you. All responses and data will be de-identified. You will not be added to any mailing lists as a result of taking this survey. By taking this survey you agree to Blue Wire's Terms of Service: <a href="https://www.bluewirepods.com/bw-terms-of-service">https://www.bluewirepods.com/bw-terms-of-service</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW4 #GW5 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Vis