		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Common Sense FPL Takes for All 20 Premier League Clubs (GW1–3 Review)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join hosts Josh and Brandon as we debate the key players and strategies from this season's opening three fantasy gameweeks. While it seems daunting with so many premium assets delivering (in a big way), in this episode we look for common sense FPL takeaways beyond the usual "you can't have everyone" cliché. Is it possible (nay crucial) to have both Salah and Haaland? Is Cole Palmer as much of a factor as some think? And who are the obvious mid-price and bargain options that we've simply missed? There's much to discuss as we head into the international break. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Lkrt-h1r1M">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Lkrt-h1r1M</a></p><p>Support the Cheaters and get exclusive ad-free FPL content: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating">https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating</a></p><p>Win at FPL! Join Fantasy Football Hub this season with 50% off your membership at any tier using this link: <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always">https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p>$500 GIFT CARD GIVEAWAY! Complete this audience survey and help us give you a better advertising experience: <a href="http://bluewirepods.com/survey">http://bluewirepods.com/survey</a> Our network partner Blue Wire is giving away two (2) $500 gift cards for participating. For a chance to win, you must complete the entire survey, including entering your name and email so we can get in contact with you. All responses and data will be de-identified. You will not be added to any mailing lists as a result of taking this survey. By taking this survey you agree to Blue Wire's Terms of Service: <a href="https://www.bluewirepods.com/bw-terms-of-service">https://www.bluewirepods.com/bw-terms-of-service</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW3 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
