		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[What We Learned Through GW2, Plus a GW3 FPL Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join Brandon and guest co-host Pat to discuss the weekend's barnstorming Premier League fixtures and consider what it all means for our fantasy squads. Arsenal made a title statement, but was that convincing win at Villa Park overshadowed by Erling Haaland's (triple) hat trick? Are budget picks like Emile Smith Rowe and Joao Pedro quickly finding their form? And what prompted that epic goal explosion from Chelsea at the Molineux? Plus, we look ahead to GW3 and pick the standout fixtures, optimal captains, and the all important xDIH stars. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Win at FPL! Join Fantasy Football Hub this season with 50% off your membership at any tier using this link: <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always">https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/K6MXCNw2Sgg">https://www.youtube.com/live/K6MXCNw2Sgg</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW2 #GW3 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
