			<title><![CDATA[FPL Takeaways from Every GW1 Match Plus Our Transfer Advice for GW2]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join us as Josh and Brandon discuss the weekend's opening round of Premier League fixtures and consider what it all means for our fantasy squads. What did we immediately get right or wrong? And what's worth changing in our teams right now versus staying patient and trusting our initial plans? Plus, we look ahead to GW2 and pick the standout fixtures, optimal captains, and the all important xDIH stars. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Win at FPL! Join Fantasy Football Hub this season with 50% off your membership at any tier using this link: <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always">https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J-l0aYAbr3M">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J-l0aYAbr3M</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW1 #GW2 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
