		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[FPL Is Back: First Thoughts, Player Prices, and New Game Mechanics for the 2024/25 Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL site is officially live for the 2024/25 Premier League season, meaning it's again time to log in, secure a low team ID, and get down to business. In this episode, we run through initial thoughts on player pricing and changes to the overall game mechanics. Which players are priced too high, too low, or just right? Can we possibly afford Erling Haaland at £15 million—officially the most expensive asset in history? And how are we feeling about the new ability to bank up to five free transfers? Plus, we of course discuss ways we'll make this FPL season more fun than the last. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Join Fantasy Football Hub this season with 50% off your membership at any tier using this link: <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always">https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qN5xkoMaI7o">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qN5xkoMaI7o</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW1 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/FPL-Is-Back-First-Thoughts--Player-Prices--and-New-Game-Mechanics-for-the-202425-Season-e347ae0</link>
