		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Goodbye to the 2023-24 FPL Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>As the 2023–24 fantasy season comes to a end, the Cheaters take one final look at the stories, moments, and lessons learned in a year that many FPL managers found challenging. But what’s changing, if anything? Whether it’s emerging Premier League players and clubs or simply new ways to view and strategize around the fantasy game, join us in closing things out for the summer. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dgdEMmLkWlI&t=67s">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dgdEMmLkWlI&t=67s</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW38 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
