		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Attacking the Forgotten FPL Gameweek 36]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>We're close to GW35's end and it's still a shootout between Son Heung-min and Cole Palmer. Brandon is joined on this week's episode by friend and veteran FPL manager <a href="https://twitter.com/dweigner">Dave Weigner-Lodahl</a> to unpack the stories of the weekend and then look ahead to a forgotten GW36 that's sandwiched between two doubles. It's a game-week that will likely come down to the captaincy pick, but have we learned anything about Liverpool, Arsenal, Chelsea, Spurs, or the two Manchester clubs that might give us an edge going into the next deadline? Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GHiNqyShp18">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GHiNqyShp18</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW35 #GW36 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
