		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Activating Our FPL Wildcards Ahead of GW35!]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>There's no rest for the FPL weary as GW34 rolls on while we're already forced to turn our attention to the next batch of doubles just around the corner. What that means for both Josh and Brandon is activating their wildcards ahead of GW35 when Chelsea and Spurs will play twice. But who (apart from Cole Palmer, of course) on these mercurial teams can fantasy managers trust? Is Nicolas Jackson poised to surprise or disappoint? Can the defenses of either club produce more points than injuries? Plus, as part of our wildcard planning, we look ahead to the GW37 doubles and key teams like Manchester City, Manchester United, and Newcastle. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6tcWr7uH0k">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6tcWr7uH0k</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW34 #GW35 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Activating-Our-FPL-Wildcards-Ahead-of-GW35-e347a9v</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">3a20de8c-0058-11ef-8b08-1bec3713986e</guid>
