		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[GW29 Recap (Yikes!), FPL Look-Ahead, and Kings of the Gameweek Special]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>On this week's episode, the Cheaters recap the wild non-results of blank GW29 and discuss what went wrong—and what could've gone worse—on the Free Hit chip. With the season's final international break ahead of us, we also take a beat to consider our strategies for the fantasy season's run-in, including the potential of remaining double gameweeks and chips. Then it's time to revisit our beloved feature: Kings of the Gameweek! Looking at top scorers in GW21–29, what lessons can we learn and what patterns can we discern from the teams, players, and positions that appear in the Fantasy Premier League site's often overlooked feature? Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1TIu9C0OqZU">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1TIu9C0OqZU</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW29 #MFFA #hailcheaters #kingsofthegameweek</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/GW29-Recap-Yikes---FPL-Look-Ahead--and-Kings-of-the-Gameweek-Special-e347agt</link>
