		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[GW29 Preview: Free Hits, Transfer Ideas, and Under-the-Radar Picks]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Opinion among FPL managers is divided on how to best approach the blank GW29, but the Cheaters are both using their Free Hit chip to navigate what will be a weird and perhaps wild gameweek. In this episode, we look at a potential Free Hit draft and run through the best—and perhaps under the radar—picks from each of the eight featuring clubs. Even if you don't plan to use a chip this deadline, the player and club analysis is still a useful exercise for narrowing down where to find an edge in a tricky moment. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HDSgyAqgqik&t=3837s">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HDSgyAqgqik&t=3837s</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW28 #GW29 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
