		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Bournemouth & Luton Town Hot Take Zone Plus GW28 Questions]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Despite our best plans, Ollie Watkins and Phil Foden continue to dictate the Fantasy Premier League terms with the two star players combining for 116 points in their last six gameweeks. But they're not the stars of this episode as the Cheaters look ahead to the double in GW28 featuring Bournemouth and Luton Town—two clubs who rarely clog up the FPL conversation. But if we must, we will, and Josh and Brandon offer their best hot takes on viable options on each team from keepers and defenders to midfielders and forwards. Plus, there's a push to potentially triple captain Dominic Solanke with his two plum home fixtures: Is it a sensible and insane chip strategy? We also preview our own squads and strategies for the double with more green arrows on our minds. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1M9JGn9B3Cw&t=143s">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1M9JGn9B3Cw&t=143s</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW27 #GW28 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Bournemouth--Luton-Town-Hot-Take-Zone-Plus-GW28-Questions-e347abd</link>
