		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Making Moves for the FPL Stretch Run Plus Our GW27 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Hindsight is in full view for FPL managers after this weekend's lopsided fantasy duel between Douglas Luis and Hwang Hee-chan. That was a key midfield transfer as the overall points tally for GW26. In this episode, Josh and Brandon recap where their squads are ahead of the West Ham-Brentford match and then look ahead to their strategies and captain picks for a somewhat forgotten GW27. What role will the Manchester Derby play in the upcoming gameweek? And how worried should we be about Erling Haaland's goal-scoring form when we compare the Norwegian to other tempting captains like Bukayo Saka? We also discuss the fallout from the League Cup final in which Liverpool sustained yet more injuries and Chelsea burned through some much needed energy ahead of a midweek FA Cup clash with Leeds that will play into our fantasy plans for the stretch run.</p><p>Watch this episode unfold in video format on our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06rBwpPUKJw&t=6s">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06rBwpPUKJw&t=6s</a></p><p>#bluewirevideo #FPL #PL #GW26 #GW27 #MFFA #hailcheaters</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Making-Moves-for-the-FPL-Stretch-Run-Plus-Our-GW27-Preview-e347aa6</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">e99e9044-d45b-11ee-8431-af687625cce8</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 26 Feb 2024 04:07:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097542/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121290-44100-2-7a86d713ff779739.mp3" length="79342266" type="audio/mpeg"/>
