		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Triple Captain Haaland? Plus More Advice & Strategies for Double GW25]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>This weekend’s GW24 fixtures saw returns for many key fantasy assets who set the table for a double gameweek showdown with Liverpool and Manchester City both getting their say in GW25. But with European competitions coming back into the picture, and a blank for some clubs in GW26, some fantasy decisions this deadline aren’t as easy as they look. On this episode, we look at the best transfer targets for the doublers, including Luton Town and Brentford, and what ripple effects we should keep in mind. Along with a lengthy Darwin Nunez vs Ivan Toney chat, there’s also an on-air toggle of the Triple Captain chip. #BlueWireVideo</p><p>To see it unfold on video, check out video for this episode on YouTube here: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fN5HYMjWq9Y&t=702s">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fN5HYMjWq9Y&t=702s</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Triple-Captain-Haaland--Plus-More-Advice--Strategies-for-Double-GW25-e347ael</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">1bf0b646-c951-11ee-98cb-8783b460486c</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
