		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Answering Your FPL Festive Fixture Questions]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The trauma of real life and Tom Lockyer bleeds through into this episode's recap of GW17, after which we attempt to refocus on the fantasy game and the remaining fixtures in the Premier League's festive period. With this weekend having offered renewed faith in clean sheets, we debate if manager's should reinvest in their goalkeeper and defenders—and, if so, then who?—and how we can possibly ever afford the in-form-but-extremely-expensive Trent Alexander-Arnold. Plus, we update our strategies on keeping, selling, or re-buying Erling Haaland when the time is right, and we discuss Chelsea, Arsenal, and players soon to leave for international tournaments in Africa and Asia. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Interested in advertising on this podcast? Email <a href="mailto:sales@bluewirepods.com">sales@bluewirepods.com</a>!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Answering-Your-FPL-Festive-Fixture-Questions-e347aij</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">5d26e7b2-9d68-11ee-8466-6383fd6b84cf</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 18 Dec 2023 05:48:01 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097811/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121645-44100-2-a5e3054698c50876.mp3" length="68125597" type="audio/mpeg"/>
