		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[One FPL Hot Take for All Twenty Premier League Clubs]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Sure, podcasting is a lot about voicing an opinion—controversial or not. This week, Josh and Brandon try to take that to the next level by limiting themselves to just one 'hot take' per Premier League side. Some of these takes might be hotter than others, but the Cheaters pin their feelings to the mast from top-of-the-table Arsenal all the way down to last-place Burnley. How many will you agree with; and how many, shall we say, less so? Let us know! Plus, of course, we look ahead to the key transfer targets and captaincy options for GW14 and the upcoming run of festive fixtures. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/One-FPL-Hot-Take-for-All-Twenty-Premier-League-Clubs-e347ah3</link>
