		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[News from the International Break & Getting Our FPL Squads Ready for GW13]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>On this episode we review the up-to-date International Break news, including injury scares, minutes played, distance traveled, and of course goal-scoring form. What do the international football results tell us about GW13? And what's the best way to set up our fantasy squads for what looks like a tricky slate of fixtures? A key decision will be the captaincy with the two standard picks Haaland and Salah facing off in the gameweek's first kickoff, it could be a good moment to be different and give the armband to Son—or even Solanke. Do we have the guts? Plus we discuss cheap defender options, Chelsea's epic upcoming run, and a "Clásico of sorts." Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/News-from-the-International-Break--Getting-Our-FPL-Squads-Ready-for-GW13-e347ah7</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">1898092e-875f-11ee-a3c3-a73f017f3bc3</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 20 Nov 2023 04:44:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097767/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121537-44100-2-3b02800a71a2eace.mp3" length="70702628" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;On this episode we review the up-to-date International Break news, including injury scares, minutes played, distance traveled, and of course goal-scoring form. What do the international football results tell us about GW13? And what&apos;s the best way to set up our fantasy squads for what looks like a tricky slate of fixtures? A key decision will be the captaincy with the two standard picks Haaland and Salah facing off in the gameweek&apos;s first kickoff, it could be a good moment to be different and give the armband to Son—or even Solanke. Do we have the guts? Plus we discuss cheap defender options, Chelsea&apos;s epic upcoming run, and a &quot;Clásico of sorts.&quot; Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn more about your ad choices. Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices&quot;&gt;podcastchoices.com/adchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</itunes:summary>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<itunes:duration>01:13:38</itunes:duration>
			<itunes:image href="https://d3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net/staging/podcast_uploaded_episode/43879241/bd6dbf1aee07e6d0.jpg"/>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The Match of the Season (So Far) & Our UK Travel Diary]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>In this episode we recap our adventures in England during the last few days, including attending the 4-4 thriller at Stamford Bridge that saw Manchester City drop points while Chelsea continues their comeback charge up the league table. We also give our impressions of the London Stadium and Selhurst Park after our visits to those grounds, which also delivered engaging matches. Plus, more on our appearance on the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=shared&v=80-vFzm2q5w">Premier League’s Fantasy Show</a> and highlights from our listener meet-up in London Bridge. We’ll return next week with a full GW13 preview and more regularly scheduled programming. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/The-Match-of-the-Season-So-Far--Our-UK-Travel-Diary-e347a5f</link>
