		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The First Double Gameweek of the FPL Season & Our GW7 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The recent GW6 had some major highs and lows for fantasy managers and Josh and Brandon represent both sides of that coin. And after we break down our learnings from the weekend, it's on to GW7 and this season's first double gameweek featuring Burnley and Luton Town. Those aren't the most enticing clubs to tie your FPL fortunes to, but this episode really is all about the pros and cons of pursuing the upside of just about any double gameweek. So, is this one "just about" enough for us? Listen to find out. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/The-First-Double-Gameweek-of-the-FPL-Season--Our-GW7-Preview-e347aa0</link>
