		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Six Unanswered Questions Ahead of the New FPL Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>We're now four weeks out from the start of the new Premier League season and, with it, the GW1 FPL deadline. At this point, the fantasy deadline feels like it's at once right around the corner and a lifetime away. So, where's the best place for us to put our focus now? Brandon and guest co-host Dave Weigner-Lodahl tackle six big questions that remain unanswered in the pre-season, including preferred team formations, goalkeeper strategy, and seeking to break the early FPL template. Plus we review recent transfer news with the likes of Anne Onana, Jurriën Timber, and Pau Torres all making moves. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Join Fantasy Football Hub this season with 50% your membership at any tier using this link: <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always">https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
