		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[FPL Is Back - First Thoughts, Strategies, and Questions for the New Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL site is officially live for the new 2023/24 Premier League season, meaning it's suddenly time to log in and get down to the business of winning our mini leagues and finishing with a high overall rank. In this episode, we're getting listeners up to speed with some early transfer deals, fantasy position reclassifications, and the controversial new player pricing within the fantasy game. Then Josh and Brandon hit upon early premium asset strategies, team formations, and the endless (mindless?) pre-season tinkering. Plus, we of course discuss new ways to make this FPL season as—or more—fun than the last. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Join Fantasy Football Hub this season with 50% your membership at any tier using this link: <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always">https://www.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
