		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Rapid-Fire GW21 Preview & Listener Mailbag]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Because the GW20 doubles stretched out the proceedings, fantasy managers now have just one day to tinker ahead of Saturday's GW21 deadline. We quickly review what was learned from recent matches like the North London Derby and Manchester City's continued up-and-down form and discuss how it all applies to the weekend. Plus, Manchester United might hold even more appeal in FPL with a potential double in GW22—what's Rashford's points floor if that happens? Then it's a listener mailbag in which we answer your questions on Mahrez, De Bruyne, Toney, Mitrovic, and more. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Rapid-Fire-GW21-Preview--Listener-Mailbag-e347anp</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">99507c8a-987d-11ed-83b6-4f0d2dca0530</guid>
