		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The Arsenal-Man City Blank. The Liverpool Dilemma. The GW11 Preview.]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Arsenal and Manchester City are each enjoying incredible form—sadly just in time for their fantasy fixture blank in GW12. In this week's episode the Cheaters break down the best ways to navigate possibly selling off six of our best FPL assets for missing merely one gameweek. What can we justify? How many Arsenal or Man City players can we stand to keep? Would we consider a Free Hit? If we're wildcarding around GW12, then when exactly? We also discuss how Liverpool's (and more specifically Mo Salah's) form effects our upcoming transfer decisions and look ahead to Friday's GW11 deadline. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/The-Arsenal-Man-City-Blank--The-Liverpool-Dilemma--The-GW11-Preview-e347ajm</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">e9ac03d0-491c-11ed-9d96-73879748df37</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Tue, 11 Oct 2022 04:29:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097846/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121675-44100-2-fd188136e4429028.mp3" length="66342818" type="audio/mpeg"/>
