			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;As we enter the Premier League&apos;s first international break of the season, the Cheaters review gameweeks 1–8 through the lens of each week&apos;s dream team. That&apos;s right—it&apos;s once again time for the Kings of the Gameweek. What lessons can we learn and what patterns can we discern from the teams, players, and positions that appear in the FPL site&apos;s often overlooked feature? We also discuss our scores from GW8, Josh&apos;s wildcard satisfaction levels, and the increasingly heated managerial sack race. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn more about your ad choices. Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices&quot;&gt;podcastchoices.com/adchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</itunes:summary>
