		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Fest NYC Announcement (With Mark Sutherns & Ed Gray)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Always Cheating podcast is thrilled to announce tickets are now available for Fest NYC, the inaugural Fantasy Football Fest event in the United States. Join Josh and Brandon in Brooklyn, NY, on September 10th for an exclusive Premier League watch party with superstar FPL guests including Fantasy Football Scout founder <a href="https://twitter.com/FFScout_Mark">Mark Sutherns</a> and Premier League pundit <a href="https://twitter.com/GianniButtice">Gianni Buttice</a>. Enjoy a raucous live Always Cheating podcast recording, a Q&A with Mark, Gianni's halftime football quiz (with prizes), a kick-around on our venue’s indoor pitch, and so much more.</p><p>Tickets will go fast, so visit <a href="https://www.fest-nyc.com">Fest-NYC.com</a> now for details and purchase information.</p><p>Special thanks to our featured sponsor <a href="https://www.fplgameweek.com">FPL Gameweek</a>.</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Fest-NYC-Announcement-With-Mark-Sutherns--Ed-Gray-e347a65</link>
