		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ten Unanswered Questions Ahead of the New FPL Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>This week the Cheaters attempt to solve some of this pre-season's biggest unanswered fantasy questions: After nightmares last year with Ronaldo and Lukaku, is Erling Haaland about to spring another "big up front" trap? How worried should we be about highly-owned players going into GW1? What mid-table teams are set up for the best start? How many premium players can FPL managers afford to set up with? And what's the impact of the new goalkeeper pricing structure? Plus, a few more conundrums—join us for the discussion!</p><p>We are also proud to announce Fest NYC, the inaugural Fantasy Football Fest event in the United States happening September 10th in Brooklyn, NY. Visit <a href="https://www.fest-nyc.com">Fest-NYC.com</a> for details and ticket information.</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Ten-Unanswered-Questions-Ahead-of-the-New-FPL-Season-e347aho</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">965b669a-00e1-11ed-9808-83433322bdeb</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 11 Jul 2022 06:36:21 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097784/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121482-44100-2-07d0446601956411.mp3" length="85577429" type="audio/mpeg"/>
