		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Your FPL Guide to Navigating GW30]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>With only four fixtures and eight teams in play for GW30, it's going to be one of the season's more stressful deadlines. Whether you're on a Free Hit chip or weighing up the benefits of various transfer hits, the Cheaters are here to navigate this gameweek's many difficulties. We look at the best forwards to own, identify some under-the-radar midfield picks, and consider the likelihood of any clean sheets—like, will we see a single one in GW30? Plus we size up the captaincy options and run through plans for our own FPL squads. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Your-FPL-Guide-to-Navigating-GW30-e347ahg</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">53ae1ffe-a353-11ec-bf39-1779774e9f39</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 14 Mar 2022 05:01:28 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097776/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121628-44100-2-a1f7b416d9738d0c.mp3" length="67251088" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;With only four fixtures and eight teams in play for GW30, it&apos;s going to be one of the season&apos;s more stressful deadlines. Whether you&apos;re on a Free Hit chip or weighing up the benefits of various transfer hits, the Cheaters are here to navigate this gameweek&apos;s many difficulties. We look at the best forwards to own, identify some under-the-radar midfield picks, and consider the likelihood of any clean sheets—like, will we see a single one in GW30? Plus we size up the captaincy options and run through plans for our own FPL squads. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn more about your ad choices. Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices&quot;&gt;podcastchoices.com/adchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
