		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Previewing the Second Half of the FPL Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>As we emerge from the hectic festive period, it's a good time to assess exactly where we are and where we're headed in this FPL season. Fixture postponements, COVID-positive players, and the upcoming African Cup of Nations all present obstacles and uncertainty, but there is still opportunity to be had in the New Year. This week we're previewing the teams and players poised to benefit from double gameweeks and also discuss our strategy for the Egypt–bound Mohamed Salah. Plus, there's a debate on chip strategy with new wildcards and free hits at our disposal. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Previewing-the-Second-Half-of-the-FPL-Season-e347ahq</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">c81de78a-6c5c-11ec-aaf9-ef4b3ec32172</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 03 Jan 2022 06:20:00 GMT</pubDate>
