			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;As we emerge from the hectic festive period, it&apos;s a good time to assess exactly where we are and where we&apos;re headed in this FPL season. Fixture postponements, COVID-positive players, and the upcoming African Cup of Nations all present obstacles and uncertainty, but there is still opportunity to be had in the New Year. This week we&apos;re previewing the teams and players poised to benefit from double gameweeks and also discuss our strategy for the Egypt–bound Mohamed Salah. Plus, there&apos;s a debate on chip strategy with new wildcards and free hits at our disposal. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn more about your ad choices. Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices&quot;&gt;podcastchoices.com/adchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
