		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Pep Talks, Points-Chasing, and "Making the Leap" in FPL with Eric Freeman]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>We're joined by special guest Eric Freeman to review the action from GW10 and give a pep talk to some FPL managers who have had a rough time of it. After cracking the world's top 10,000 rankings for the first time in his fantasy career, Eric also discusses how he thinks he has succeeded so far this season. What can others do to "make the leap" to that next level? Plus, we debate player differentials, Ivan Toney's usefulness (or lack thereof), and Ronaldo's potential FPL comeback, as well as our transfer and captaincy thoughts ahead of GW11. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>A big thank-you to Always Cheating supporter John Reynolds for this week's outro music!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Pep-Talks--Points-Chasing--and-Making-the-Leap-in-FPL-with-Eric-Freeman-e347aat</link>
