		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Josh's Wildcard Is Active & GW5 FPL Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Ronaldo's explosive GW4 debut was matched by a brace from Lukaku, making the choice of premium forwards that much more challenging for FPL managers. Josh enters this week's episode with an active wildcard and this question of Ronaldo vs Lukaku is key to his strategy as he and Brandon debate the merits of fitting both into one fantasy squad. Will it work? Or does it strain the budget too much? We also discuss standout mid-price forwards and look at the current crop of budget forwards that might help free up some cash before we preview the fixtures and captaincy options for GW5. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Joshs-Wildcard-Is-Active--GW5-FPL-Preview-e347aj8</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">720e403c-144c-11ec-91f9-6b91466e82a8</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 13 Sep 2021 04:44:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097832/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121641-44100-2-98fdbf6fa7d084cc.mp3" length="81130369" type="audio/mpeg"/>
