			<itunes:duration>01:24:05</itunes:duration>
			<itunes:image href="https://d3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net/staging/podcast_uploaded_episode/43879241/187f01a9f013d3f9.jpg"/>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Mailbag Time: Your FPL Questions Answered & GW4 Preview]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>This international break has offered drama and intrigue of all sorts, but we at Always Cheating won't allow ourselves to be too distracted from the GW4 deadline that's quickly approaching. So, has any of the news from World Cup qualifying changed our views on what to do with our FPL teams? We dig into the listener mailbag to answer major concerns over Ronaldo hype, Bruno doubt, Lukaku thigh scans, and the relevance of the still-delivering mid-price forwards like Dominic Calvert-Lewin, Michail Antonio, and Patrick Bamford. And what do we make of the impending Champions League schedule and its impact on Premier League squad rotation? Plus, we rank the current midfield options and take a long look at obvious and not-so-obvious captaincy choices for the weekend. Hail Cheaters!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/Mailbag-Time-Your-FPL-Questions-Answered--GW4-Preview-e347afc</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">7edc82dc-0f5c-11ec-991f-1fc20a3ff10c</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 06 Sep 2021 21:52:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097708/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121470-44100-2-27a2db73d34273bc.mp3" length="67018619" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;This international break has offered drama and intrigue of all sorts, but we at Always Cheating won&apos;t allow ourselves to be too distracted from the GW4 deadline that&apos;s quickly approaching. So, has any of the news from World Cup qualifying changed our views on what to do with our FPL teams? We dig into the listener mailbag to answer major concerns over Ronaldo hype, Bruno doubt, Lukaku thigh scans, and the relevance of the still-delivering mid-price forwards like Dominic Calvert-Lewin, Michail Antonio, and Patrick Bamford. And what do we make of the impending Champions League schedule and its impact on Premier League squad rotation? Plus, we rank the current midfield options and take a long look at obvious and not-so-obvious captaincy choices for the weekend. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn more about your ad choices. Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices&quot;&gt;podcastchoices.com/adchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</itunes:summary>
