		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[FPL Is Back - Building Your Final Squad for GW1]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>There's less than one week to prepare for the start of the new FPL season and we still have a number of unanswered questions. Join Josh and Brandon as they discuss their final team selection dilemmas—which positions and players are locks and where will there be some last-minute GW1 deadline decisions? We also look at how recent transfers—like Grealish to Manchester City, Ings to Aston Villa, and Lukaku to Chelsea—impact our fantasy drafts and if we've pinpointed any assets flying under the radar. Thank you for joining Always Cheating during our pre-season coverage and we're wishing all of our listeners the best of luck for the 2021/22 campaign. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Receive a 25% discount on your Fantasy Football Hub membership: <a href="https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always/">fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/FPL-Is-Back---Building-Your-Final-Squad-for-GW1-e347a85</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">210ce5ac-f8be-11eb-92f4-ffc6f8b742c0</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 09 Aug 2021 03:05:00 GMT</pubDate>
