		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[31 Tips for Winning FPL and Making Fantasy Fun Again]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>What will it take to win the Fantasy Premier League this season? How can you more easily hit your goals or beat your mini league rivals? And, perhaps most importantly, what does it mean to simply enjoy the upcoming 38 gameweeks? In this pre-season episode, we welcome friend-of-the-podcast <a href="https://twitter.com/EricDFreeman">Eric Freeman</a> to outline our best tips for FPL success and making the fantasy experience more fun and rewarding. We recognize that doing well in the fantasy game can mean different things to different people, often depending on your style of play and level of competitiveness, so these 31 key principles offer something for every type of manager at every level of engagement. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Receive a 25% discount on your Fantasy Football Hub membership: <a href="https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always/">fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/31-Tips-for-Winning-FPL-and-Making-Fantasy-Fun-Again-e347a7k</link>
