		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[An Introduction to the 2021/22 FPL Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>And, just like that, a new fantasy season has arrived. The FPL site relaunched for 2021/22 on Tuesday of this week, amidst the noise of the European Championship, but it didn't go unnoticed among the fantasy faithful. Josh and Brandon return to their podcasting chairs to discuss the new player prices, position reclassifications, and fixture difficulty ratings, as well as their own strategies for the opening few gameweeks. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Receive a 25% discount on your Fantasy Football Hub membership: <a href="https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always/">fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
