		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Locker Room: USMNT v Mexico & Premier League Off-Season Chat]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Josh and Brandon hop on Locker Room this week to chat with listeners about the CONCACAF Nations League Final between the U.S. and Mexico. How are we feeling at the moment about Gregg Berhalter's talented young squad now with a fair amount of European experience? Plus, we get into some of the Premier League off-season gossip, including transfer rumors and promoted club prospects.</p><p>Join us each week on the Locker Room app for real-time conversations Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/hailcheaters">@hailcheaters</a> for exact dates/times and download the Locker Room app for iOS here: <a href="https://joinlockerroom.com">https://joinlockerroom.com</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
