		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Locker Room: Champions League Final Reaction]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Chelsea are crowned European champions after Thomas Tuchel again out-smarts Pep Guardiola. The Cheaters Josh and Brandon take to the Locker Room app to discuss their thoughts on an engaging Champions League final and also get reactions from listeners. Did Pep predictably overthink his tactics? Just how good was Mason Mount's assist on Kai Havertz's match-winning goal? And what does this final tell us about next season's Premier League title race?</p><p>Join us each week on the Locker Room app for real-time conversations with Josh, Brandon, and other Always Cheating listeners. Follow us on Twitter at <a href="https://twitter.com/hailcheaters"><strong>@hailcheaters</strong></a> for exact times each week and download the Locker Room app at <a href="https://joinlockerroom.com/"><strong>joinlockerroom.com</strong></a>.</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
