		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Stock Up/Stock Down Through Gameweek 4]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Premier League insanity continues with outrageous shorelines and results occurring throughout GW4. But, with still so much volatility within the league and FPL, who's fantasy stock is up as we head into the international break? And whose stock is actually going down? We discuss all twenty teams and attempt to pinpoint which of them are currently worthy of our time and investment. Always Cheating will return next week with a full preview of the GW5 fixtures and captaincy picks. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Always Cheating listeners can now enjoy a 15% discount on memberships at Fantasy Football Hub. To learn all about the Hub's powerful FPL tools and features, and to secure your membership, visit: <a href="https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always/">https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always/</a></p>
