			<pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2020 07:44:56 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097691/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121415-44100-2-36590e309e0d340c.mp3" length="91644233" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;The first deadline of the new FPL season is less than a week away and it&apos;s time to get serious about our GW1 squads. Josh and Brandon discuss the strategy behind each of their current fantasy drafts and pinpoint which players remain locked into their lineup versus those who may not make the final cut. Plus, we preview this weekend&apos;s eight fixtures, weigh the favorite captaincy options, and plan ahead for September&apos;s subsequent gameweeks. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Always Cheating listeners can now enjoy a 25% discount on memberships at Fantasy Football Hub. To learn all about the Hub&apos;s powerful FPL tools and features, and to secure your membership, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always/&quot;&gt;https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
