		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Interview with Joe Lepper of Fantasy Football Scout]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>In a special bonus episode of the show, we’re joined by writer and podcaster <a href="https://twitter.com/FFScout_Joe">Joe Lepper</a> of Fantasy Football Scout. Joe is a fixture in the fantasy community, but he’s also known for his incredible FPL record, which features six top 10K overall rank finishes (including one top 1K finish), having never finished outside the top 100K during his twelve-year career. We asked Joe about his winning FPL strategy and how it has evolved through the years, along with the challenges he’s anticipating for next season. We also chat with Joe about his experiences as an FPL content creator, having worked with some of the best minds in the fantasy arena, and his excellent <a href="https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk/2019/01/07/meet-the-managers-top-tips-from-fpls-most-successful-managers/">“Meet the Manager”</a> interview series for the Scout. Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
