		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[FPL Player Price Predictions]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>As we wait for the Fantasy Premier League site to relaunch, we take this moment to predict a handful of key player prices. From Ziyech and Werner to Mitrovic and Jiménez, along with the likes of Alexander-Arnold and De Bruyne, we discuss new signings, returning favorites, and those players who are ready to make that leap into the elite echelon of fantasy price tags. Stay tuned for much more pre-season podcast content in the coming weeks. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Always Cheating listeners can now enjoy a 30% discount on memberships at Fantasy Football Hub. To learn all about the Hub's powerful FPL tools and features, and to secure your membership, visit: <a href="https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always30/">https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/always30/</a></p>
