		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[End of Season Review (Look for the Helpers)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Heartbreak! Triumph! Chaos! The 2019–20 Premier League season has finally reached its conclusion, and with it one of the longest and most challenging FPL campaigns in memory. So, what lessons did we learn that might help fantasy mangers in the future? What did we make of all of the recent controversy surrounding leaked team sheets? And, looking ahead to next season, which players will be nailed in our squads or flagged as rising stars, exciting new signings, and worthy punts?</p><p>Thanks to all of our listeners for yet another amazing year of podcasts. The show will be back, as usual, in a few weeks, ahead of the launch of the new FPL game. We'll talk to you then! Hail Cheaters!</p><p>This week's episode of the Always Cheating Podcast is presented by Manscaped. For precision-engineered male grooming tools, visit <a href="https://www.manscaped.com">Manscaped.com</a> and use the code <strong>CHEATING</strong> for 20% off plus free shipping.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/End-of-Season-Review-Look-for-the-Helpers-e347a8n</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">904b9456-93a1-47a5-9a78-06712c559d80</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
