		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Bundesliga Chat with Ronan Murphy of Goal.com]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Germany’s Bundesliga returned to action this weekend, spurring many football fans around the world to tune in for their first glimpse of live sports in months. So, did Borussia Dortmund vs Schalke 04 or Eintracht Frankfurt vs Mönchengladbach deliver on the excitement we craved? Was it strange watching football broadcast from empty stadiums? And how was our first experience with Germany's fantasy game? This week, we are joined by guest <a href="https://twitter.com/swearimnotpaul">Ronan Murphy</a> (social producer and journalist for <a href="https://www.goal.com/">Goal</a>) to discuss the Bundesliga's narrative threads, notable clubs, and key players that novice fans like us are missing. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Please consider supporting our beloved Black Horse Pub in Brooklyn: <a href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff">https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff</a></p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a welcome bonus.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
