		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Getting to Know the Bundesliga]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>It looks as though Germany’s Bundesliga will be the first major European league to return to action when their 2019–20 season resumes on May 16. In anticipation of next weekend’s action, we’re dedicating this episode to getting to know some of the teams, players, and stories currently dominating the German top division. We discuss everything from Robert Lewandowski and the modern Bayern Munich dynasty to Timo Werner and RB Leipzig’s divisive business practices, along with hipster club Borussia Dortmund’s young phenoms Jadon Sancho and Erling Håland. Plus, we spell Mönchengladbach. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Please consider supporting our beloved Black Horse Pub in Brooklyn: <a href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff">https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff</a></p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a welcome bonus.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
