		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Football Mailbag Time!]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Without any concrete news to report from the Premier League and FPL, we’ve turned to our listeners for topics. In this week’s “mailbag” episode, we answer questions about the state of football in quarantine. How can this season be salvaged? Will FPL ever come back? And, well, here’s an easy one: How do we define money and measure the cost of late-stage capitalism? Plus, in the most cheerful way possible, we reveal which clubs we’d most like to buy and/or destroy. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Please consider supporting our beloved Black Horse Pub in Brooklyn: <a href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff">https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff</a></p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a welcome bonus.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
