		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Little Things We Miss the Most]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Sure, the Premier League and FPL have all but vanished. But what else do we miss? From the solitude of a morning commute and the taste of movie theater popcorn to that tactile, emotional feeling of hugging your friends, in this episode of Always Cheating we're drafting our favorite little things that we never knew we'd struggle to live without. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Please consider supporting our beloved Black Horse Pub in Brooklyn: <a href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff">https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-black-horse-staff</a></p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a welcome bonus.</p>
