		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The Ultimate Draft of Things We Miss]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Premier League and the fantasy game have very particular places in our weekly and daily lives. But, given our current crisis, virtually every aspect of sport has vanished. So we at Always Cheating decided to have an old fashioned draft to call out and draw in those specific players and teams, cherished moments of the average sports week, and other elements of following the league and our clubs that we truly miss the most. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 100% welcome bonus.</p>
