		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The Best Sports Movies, Football or Otherwise]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Sports are still on hiatus, but while everyone's in social isolation, movies have become a pretty good way to get our sports fix. So, while we're all looking for content to stream at home, we thought it was a good week to reflect our favorite sports movies of all time. From 'The Damned United' and 'Rocky IV,' to 'Major League' and 'Hoop Dreams,' our discussion hits on virtually every sport, every genre, and every mood. Let us know which of your favorite films we might have missed. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 100% welcome bonus.</p>
