			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;Sports are still on hiatus, but while everyone&apos;s in social isolation, movies have become a pretty good way to get our sports fix. So, while we&apos;re all looking for content to stream at home, we thought it was a good week to reflect our favorite sports movies of all time. From &apos;The Damned United&apos; and &apos;Rocky IV,&apos; to &apos;Major League&apos; and &apos;Hoop Dreams,&apos; our discussion hits on virtually every sport, every genre, and every mood. Let us know which of your favorite films we might have missed. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Presented by &lt;a href=&quot;https://betonline.ag&quot;&gt;BetOnline.ag&lt;/a&gt;. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 100% welcome bonus.&lt;/p&gt;
