		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[FPL Quarantine & Our UK Travel Diary]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>While the coronavirus continues to upend life as we know it, Josh and Brandon assess what this means for Premier League fans and FPL managers. Is there a chance that the season might eventually resume? Or is it over? And, if it's truly over, what are our thoughts on approaching mini-league winner payouts for a season that never truly ended? Plus, we offer up a detailed travel diary for our recent tour of England, including GW29 visits to the Emirates, Old Trafford, and the King Power, as well as appearances on the Official FPL Show with Jules Breach and James Richardson.</p><p>A quick programming note during this uncertain time: Despite a lack of FPL, we'll continue to produce the Always Cheating podcast on a weekly basis with the hope of preserving a bit of joy and normalcy for our listeners.</p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 50% welcome bonus.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
