			<title><![CDATA[Cheaters in the UK (GW29 Review, GW30 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Josh and Brandon are in the UK this week, enjoying some live match day experiences. But we're finding time in this episode to highlight key FPL issues facing managers ahead of the big blank GW31, as well as the "Forgotten Gameweek" GW30. Join us for player picks, captaincy favorites, and a few stories from our recent travels to the Emirates, Old Trafford, and King Power. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>As mentioned, look for us on this week's FPL Show and FPL FYI.</p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 50% welcome bonus.</p>
