		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Brandon's Wildcard (GW28 Review, GW29 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The action from GW28 was chaotic, to say the least, but players like Bruno Fernandes, Diogo Jota, and Dominic Calvert-Lewin continue to rack up FPL points. We're digesting all of this in the context of Brandon's wildcard, which is active during this transfer window. So, who will make the cut? And who are the differentials that will help this wildcard really climb the ranks? Plus we preview GW29 fixtures and captaincy options, along with our upcoming trip to the UK. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 50% welcome bonus.</p><p>A reminder that our London, UK, listener meet-up is set for Friday, March 6, 7:00 PM until close at <a href="https://www.coinlaundry.co.uk">Coin Laundry</a>. We hope to see you there.</p>
