		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[FPL True or FPL False? (GW27 Review, GW28 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Is it true that you can close a gap of 100 points in your FPL mini league with just eleven weeks to go? Is it false that form trumps fixtures? Is it true that Manchester United now have to be taken seriously by fantasy managers? Is it false that Kevin de Bruyne is the only Manchester City asset worth owning? Is it true that underlying stats are overrated? Is it false that there are no worthwhile midfielders priced below £6.0? We answer these questions and more, along with a preview of GW28 transfer and captaincy conundrums. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 50% welcome bonus.</p><p>A reminder that our London, UK, listener meet-up is set for Friday, March 6, 7:00 PM until close at <a href="https://www.coinlaundry.co.uk">Coin Laundry</a>. We hope to see you there.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
