		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Who's Worth a Transfer? (GW26 Review, GW27 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>As GW26 and our first Premier League winter break come to their eventual conclusions, we're turning our attention to emerging and under-the-radar transfer targets from clubs like Wolverhampton, Spurs, Arsenal, Newcastle, and Leicester City. Which players who have hit recent form are actually knee-jerk fantasy moves versus those savvy picks who will actually help you make headway in the FPL ranks? Plus, we discuss the current situation with Manchester City's potential Champions League ban and how that might impact our fantasy seasons. Stick around for our preview of GW27 captaincy favorites and transfers plans. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Presented by <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.ag</a>. Set up an account today and use promo code BLUEWIRE for a 50% welcome bonus.</p><p>A reminder that our London, UK, listener meet-up is set for Friday, March 6, 7:00 PM until close at <a href="https://www.coinlaundry.co.uk">Coin Laundry</a>. We hope to see you there.</p>
