		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ask Us Anything & GW26 Check-In]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>There's not much in the way of FPL news as we find ourselves only three-tenths of the way through a long GW26. So, we thought, what the heck? Let's just ask our listeners to send in a bunch of random fantasy and non-fantasy questions for us to answer. Listen in as Josh and Brandon critique each other's FPL tactics, talk about how they first met, and debate who of the duo would win in a penalty shootout. Hail Cheaters!</p><p>Presented by: <a href="https://betonline.ag">BetOnline.AG</a></p><p>A reminder that our London, UK, listener meet-up is scheduled for Friday, March 6, 7:00 PM until close at <a href="https://www.coinlaundry.co.uk">Coin Laundry</a> in Farringdon. We hope to see you there!</p>
