			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;There&apos;s not much in the way of FPL news as we find ourselves only three-tenths of the way through a long GW26. So, we thought, what the heck? Let&apos;s just ask our listeners to send in a bunch of random fantasy and non-fantasy questions for us to answer. Listen in as Josh and Brandon critique each other&apos;s FPL tactics, talk about how they first met, and debate who of the duo would win in a penalty shootout. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Presented by: &lt;a href=&quot;https://betonline.ag&quot;&gt;BetOnline.AG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A reminder that our London, UK, listener meet-up is scheduled for Friday, March 6, 7:00 PM until close at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinlaundry.co.uk&quot;&gt;Coin Laundry&lt;/a&gt; in Farringdon. We hope to see you there!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn more about your ad choices. Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices&quot;&gt;podcastchoices.com/adchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</itunes:summary>
