			<itunes:image href="https://d3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net/staging/podcast_uploaded_episode/43879241/4cfae03752fa1cf1.jpg"/>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Honest Answers to Difficult Questions (GW25 Review, GW26 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Let's face it: Sometimes, FPL questions can be difficult, or even downright impossible to answer. This week, we are honestly and confidently tackling all of our listeners' toughest conundrums, from premium striker woes to Championship rotation threat, Leicester City's concerning form, and the prospects of the biggest January signings. Plus, we take a closer look at the GW26 fixture list, which has been spread out due to the Winter Break, and how the staggered schedule might impact our transfers, wildcards, and captaincy picks. Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
