		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[A Few Lingering Questions (GW1 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The new FPL season is less than a week away, and Josh and Brandon are here to explore a handful of this pre-season's great unanswered questions. We debate the opposing viewpoints of the "big at the back" defensive strategy versus a more balanced approach, share our thoughts on Everton's strange summer, run through the updated list of budget forward options, and talk one more time about Harry Kane. Plus, we consider the performances of Manchester City and Liverpool in Sunday's Community Shield and how both Salah and Sterling have strengthened their potential heading into this weekend's GW1 fixtures. Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
			<link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/alwayscheating/episodes/A-Few-Lingering-Questions-GW1-Preview-e347ajb</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">gid://art19-episode-locator/V0/rgG4coJHsWVBthl4V5f_UTVSTsk1ccrDch0vRY-AtGY</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2019 05:54:58 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097835/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121596-44100-2-9f53fe1a49ae9dc0.mp3" length="87758797" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;The new FPL season is less than a week away, and Josh and Brandon are here to explore a handful of this pre-season&apos;s great unanswered questions. We debate the opposing viewpoints of the &quot;big at the back&quot; defensive strategy versus a more balanced approach, share our thoughts on Everton&apos;s strange summer, run through the updated list of budget forward options, and talk one more time about Harry Kane. Plus, we consider the performances of Manchester City and Liverpool in Sunday&apos;s Community Shield and how both Salah and Sterling have strengthened their potential heading into this weekend&apos;s GW1 fixtures. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;
