		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 175: Ten Questions for the 2019-20 FPL Season]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL site for the 2019-20 season has officially launched and fantasy managers everywhere are already tinkering with their gameweek 1 lineups. At the outset, a new FPL season always presents unexpected challenges, so Always Cheating is here to confront the biggest questions: Given their prices, which players are most likely to present the best and worst value? How many premium strikers should we budget for? Is this the year to go for four at the back? Why are goalkeepers so expensive? Which players or teams are poised to break out? And so much more. Josh & Brandon will be with you throughout the pre-season, with team-by-team previews and tips for general FPL success still to come. Hail Cheaters!<br />
Become a Patreon supporter: https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating<br />
Join our mini-league with code dtz277 at: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/join/private<br />
Twitter: https://twitter.com/hailcheaters<br />
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/hailcheaters/<br />
Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/alwayscheating<br />
Music by Zach Curd: https://zachcurd.bandcamp.com</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
