			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;Excitement reigns as the FIFA 2019 Women&apos;s World Cup kicks off in France this Friday, June 7. For a preview of the action, we&apos;re joined by Jeff Kassouf, author of the new book The Making of the Women&apos;s World Cup and founder of https://equalizersoccer.com. Our conversation runs from tournament favorites and dark horses to the general state of play with women&apos;s football around the world. Jeff also fill us in on specific players to watch and which match this weekend might be a great place to start for fans who are new to the women&apos;s game. Hail Cheaters!&lt;br /&gt;
