			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;A mid-season FPL template is undeniably taking hold. But how locked-in is it, really? Are certain players like Salah, Robertson, Pogba, Rashford, Digne, Doherty, or even Jimenez simply unavoidable? This week, we discuss how to use the template to your advantage and to anticipate the changes that are always just around the corner. Plus, we evaluate Hazard&apos;s recent blanks and whether Gonzalo Higuain&apos;s imminent arrival alters our thinking. We&apos;ll return with a new episode prior to GW24, including transfer talk and captaincy picks for the upcoming midweek fixtures. Hail Cheaters!&lt;br /&gt;
