			<guid isPermaLink="false">tag:soundcloud,2010:tracks/508218060</guid>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[Always Cheating Media LLC]]></dc:creator>
			<pubDate>Tue, 02 Oct 2018 05:17:07 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097539/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121305-44100-2-2dc43051ada8c9f3.mp3" length="75189822" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;Heavy hitters are the main FPL talking point this week, with Hazard, Kane, Agüero, Salah, and Sterling all vying for our attention in different ways. Which of these players do we really need, and who can we live without? Plus, we review Josh&apos;s successful &quot;surprise&quot; wildcard from GW7, along with Brandon&apos;s first big blunder of the season. Attention U.K. friends: Get ready for an American invasion! Josh and Brandon will be in London for GW8. Check out our social channels for more details. Hail Cheaters!&lt;br /&gt;
