		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Bonus Pod: Wasting Your Wildcard (Interview with David Wardale)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>In this bonus episode, we interview David Wardale, a contributor to Fantasy Football Scout and the author of Wasting Your Wildcard: The Method and Madness of Fantasy Football, which is on sale now in paperback and ebook. David spoke to us about the process of writing such an immense book about the game (IRL and FPL) that we all love so dearly, as well as what he learned about community, methodology, addiction, stats, Norwegians, mini-league punishments, and everything in between. We're confident that our listeners will enjoy this book as much as we did. Hail Cheaters!<br />
Buy your copy of Wasting Your Wildcard now:<br />
Amazon UK: https://www.amazon.co.uk/gp/product/1787290166<br />
Amason US: https://www.amazon.com/Wasting-Your-Wildcard-Madness-Football-ebook/dp/B076VXSWX1/<br />
iBooks: https://itunes.apple.com/gb/book/wasting-your-wildcard/id1373055152?mt=11<br />
Waterstones: https://www.waterstones.com/book/wasting-your-wildcard/david-wardale/9781787290167<br />
Barnes & Noble: https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/wasting-your-wildcard-david-wardale/1129202284?ean=9781473549753<br />
Penguin UK: https://www.penguin.co.uk/books/1114612/wasting-your-wildcard/9781787290167/<br />
