			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097412/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121182-44100-2-2825c8effcf2f11a.mp3" length="71627314" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;Wildcards are now activating across the FPL community. But before we delve into strategy going forward, we have a quick review of the crazy blank GW31 that just passed. Did Salah&apos;s incredible points haul devalue all of our careful planning? What lessons did we learn from the first major Free Hit appearance? Looking ahead, Josh lays out the chip options for managers who&apos;ve already played their wildcard, while Brandon is wildcard-active and looking for must-haves and differentials to fill out his refreshed squad. We&apos;ll be back next week for a full GW32 preview. Hail Cheaters!&lt;br /&gt;
