		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 116: Black Hole (GW29-30)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>An average scoring GW29 was disappointing for most managers, but also kind of befitting the calm before the FPL storm that kicks off in GW31. In this episode, we're previewing what could be the last "normal" game week of the season in GW30. Do we dare break away from a Salah captaincy as Liverpool head to Old Trafford? Can Kane finally manage to explode for points after a demanding midweek Champions League match? Is Sterling ripe for the transfer, freeing up some needed midfield funds and a GW31 slot? Plus we take on listener questions and work through some angst about the "pretentious" bonus points system. Hail Cheaters!<br />
