		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 115: A Thousand Points of Light (GW28-29)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>While there's still one fixture left to go in GW28, we have little time to dwell. Josh and Brandon jump straight into a preview of GW29 fixtures, hunting for yet more differentials. Do oddball in-form players like Deeney and van La Parra stand a chance in our squads? Can Walcott and Wilson survive? And where do we stand with Arsenal after their Carabao Cup meltdown, given their enticing run of fixtures? Stay tuned for the inevitable digressions into blank game weeks and chip strategy. Hail Cheaters!<br />
