		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 114: Blowing It Up (Break-GW28)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>After this weekend's round of FA Cup matches, we now have a pretty full picture of the blanks that await us in GW31, and it's not pretty. Sure, the planning for those blanks starts now, but in this episode Josh and Brandon first offer up a substantial preview for GW28 fixtures, clean sheets, and captaincy picks. Second, we feature a mega lightning round of listener questions to kick our FPL strategy gears into motion ahead of the blanks. Hail Cheaters!<br />
