		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 113: Alpha Dog (GW27-Break)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Goals, goals, goals, and more goals. GW27 was epic for Agüero owners, and it also brought with it substantial tallies for highly-owned players like Salah, Firmino, and Hazard. So what are the action items for FPL managers after a week like this when we are so close to the home stretch? Is Hazard still a troll? Is Agüero becoming a risk with the imminent return of Gabriel Jesus? Will we ever not put the armband on Salah? Josh and Brandon also discuss the disappearance of Manchester United attacking assets and the current state of cheap forwards and defenders. We'll be back next week, after the FA Cup fixtures, to preview GW28 transfers, captains, and clean sheets. Hail Cheaters!<br />
