		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 112: Running Down Van Dijk (GW26-27)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>A fairly disappointing GW26 will be remembered for captaincy fails, disappearing defenders, and a few crazy moments at Anfield. And based on his performance on Sunday, there's seriously no debating that Salah is this season's FPL Points King. (However, Brandon decides to debate that point anyway.) In their GW27 preview, Josh and Brandon discuss Arsenal's alluring new look, go in search of reliable defensive alternatives, and dive deeper into chip strategy as the GW31 blanks approach. Hail Cheaters!<br />
