		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 110: Hashtag Sports (GW24-25)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Live by Agüero. Die by Agüero. GW24 was a good week for those restoring faith in the City striker, along with those who kept faith in a particular Chelsea midfielder. So where does that leave us heading into the next round? Always Cheating hosts Josh and Brandon are joined by special guest Mike DePietro (winner of our Patreon Supporters Survivor League) to discuss Alexis Sanchez, whose move to Old Trafford could rip up the existing FPL template, as well as Henrikh Mkhitaryan's jump to North London. We're also lining up midfield replacements for an injured Arnautovic and a mercurial Lingard, hashing out Free Hit and Wildcard strategies, and walking through the GW25 fixtures. Hail Cheaters!<br />
