		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 109: A Bit of the Old Ultra-Violence (GW23-24)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>If you somehow feel like you missed out on points during the recent double game week, then we sure hope you held onto Arnautovic and Son for big hauls in GW23. The Always Cheating hosts recap the scores and highlights from this past weekend. Then it's a massive team-by-team status report, from Arsenal through to West Ham, as we search the league for new under-the-radar player picks. Stay tuned for a GW24 preview with transfer thoughts and captaincy options. Hail Cheaters!<br />
