		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 108: Boys of Summer (GW22-23)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Always Cheating is back after a brief winter break to discuss the January transfer dealings and how they'll impact our FPL lineups. Will Coutinho's departure upset the attacking balance at Liverpool? Is the arrival of Virgil van Dijk finally going to make that defense an appealing option? And should we assume DCL is the odd man out with new Everton striker Cenk Tosun? We also talk about the currently hypothetical moves for Alexis Sanchez and Riyad Mahrez, then tackle a bunch of your listener questions, and preview captains and transfer targets for GW23. Hail Cheaters!<br />
