		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 107: Flan in a Cupboard (GW19-22)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Josh and Brandon emerge from their holiday hangovers to recap the key stories and players from GW19 and GW20. But, during this hectic festive period, there's little time for reflection, and this episode quickly turns to strategizing for the big GW22 double with Spurs and West Ham. How many players do we want? Or do we need? And do the free hit and triple captain chips enter into our thinking? Plus, we look more immediately to GW21 and answer listener questions on Coutinho, Lingard, Hazard, and Van Dijk. Hail Cheaters!<br />
