		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 106: Seven Days of Bad Weeks (GW18-19)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Premium strikers, almost uniformly, aren't performing. All the more reason for us to discuss them on this episode of Always Cheating. Do we have the patience to hold onto Kane until his double in GW22? Is Lukaku making a strong enough case to return to our squads? How blood-thirsty is Morata? It's also time for a regular Hazard heat check, a comparison of Zaha and Richarlison, and assessing an Arsenal defense dilemma. Stay tuned for listener questions and our GW19 preview including captain and clean sheet picks. Hail Cheaters!<br />
Become a Patreon supporter: https://www.patreon.com/alwayscheating<br />
Subscribe to our weekly email newsletter: http://www.alwayscheating.com/newsletter/<br />
