		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 104: How's Your Team? (GW15-16)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>In GW15, it was certainly "No Hazard, No Party." So it's now looking more like a matter of when and not if we get Chelsea's Belgian midfielder into our FPL lineups. Will Harry Kane make way for the necessary transfer funds? Probably not, but Josh and Brandon are judging whether other expensive players like Jesus, Agüero, Morata, Sané, and de Gea are worth their price tags. Stay tuned for listener questions on emerging transfer targets like Aaron Ramsey, as well as our fixture previews for GW16. Plus, we have a very special announcement for our Patreon supporters. Hail Cheaters!<br />
