		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 103: Don't Get Clever (GW13-15)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>As weirdly fun and excruciating as GW13 was for many FPL managers, we have precious little time to dwell upon it - not with two more game weeks mere hours away. Always Cheating hosts, Josh and Brandon, are already sizing up almost every conceivable transfer option ahead of the GW14 midweek and GW15 weekend fixtures. How essential do Chelsea assets like Hazard and Morata look now? Is it time to part ways with big strikers like Lukaku and Jesus? And is Charlie Austin the budget forward that we've all been waiting for? Plus we answer your listener questions and outline our captain picks for the next two game weeks. Hail Cheaters!<br />
