		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 93: Man in the Mirror (GW4-5)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>With #GW4 goals from Kane, Lukaku, Agüero, Jesus, Morata, and Lacazette, it's high time Josh and Brandon discuss the ideal heavy hitting strikers for our #FPL squads. How do we choose both the best players and the best formation to suit an abundance of forward talent, but perhaps a dearth of mid-price midfield selections? We also examine Liverpool's prospects following Mané's red card, buying into Tottenham's epic run of fixtures, and Abdoulaye Doucouré vs. Pascal Groß. Stay tuned for captains and clean sheet picks for #GW5. Hail Cheaters!<br />
