		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 84: Ten Rules for FPL Success (2017/18 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Ahead of the new Fantasy Premier League season, there are some rookie managers that could use a road map. And, let's face it, many of us veteran #FPL managers are in need of a tune-up when it comes to broader strategies for the game. In this episode, Josh and Brandon outline ten baseline rules (from statistical awareness and the herd mentality to squad depth and the role of luck) to help guide you through a successful season. Hail Cheaters!<br />
