		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 83: First Impressions (2017/18 Preview)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The #FPL site for 2017/18 has officially launched and Always Cheating is jumping in with initial impressions, including some of our listeners' reactions. We discuss the new "Free Hit" chip, some overpriced and underpriced players, and provide a quick rundown of first thoughts on all 20 teams in the Premier League. Stay tuned for more preview podcasts and content in the weeks to come. Hail Cheaters!<br />
