		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 81: Ragnarok (2016/17 Season Recap)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Here's to another FPL season in the history books. Always Cheating hosts Josh and Brandon take a look back at personal highs and lows, our best transfers, the most frustrating players, and what valuable lessons were learned. Thanks to all of our listeners for sticking with us through an incredible year. We'll be back later in the summer to preview next season and do this all over again. Hail Cheaters!<br />
