		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 79: Electric Sheep (GW36-37)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Goals change games and goals change gameweeks. So how did Alexis Sanchez's goal against Southampton change our outlook on GW37? Always Cheating hosts Josh and Brandon make their final preparations ahead of the biggest week of the season, discussing potential Chelsea rotation, the need for Manchester City players, and how Spurs might respond to their loss at West Ham. We also hunt around for worthwhile punts and talk about how your captaincy choice might be more crucial than ever. Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
