			<title><![CDATA[Ep 74: The Blame Game (GW30-31)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>It's a lightning quick turnaround between GW30 and GW31, but the Always Cheating hosts are still here for you. Josh and Brandon recap this weekend's highlights and Josh describes how his freshly wild-carded team performed. Then we run through all ten midweek fixtures and pick out potential clean sheets and captaincy options. Hail Cheaters!</p>
