			<pubDate>Fri, 03 Feb 2017 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104098054/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121919-44100-2-486f9ea3f8effcd6.mp3" length="56250633" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;Buckle up for some quick-fire FPL chat as Always Cheating hosts Josh and Brandon put the brutal midweek fixtures behind them and turn the attention to this weekend&apos;s GW24. We&apos;re talking about Man City&apos;s new weapon Gabriel Jesus, Tom Heaton&apos;s bonus point supremacy, and the Curious Case of Romelu Lukaku. Plus we begin preparing for the blanks in GW26 and GW28, take your listener questions, and predict captains and clean sheets. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn more about your ad choices. Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices&quot;&gt;podcastchoices.com/adchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</itunes:summary>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<itunes:duration>00:58:10</itunes:duration>
			<itunes:image href="https://d3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net/staging/podcast_uploaded_episode/43879241/1c35c48425ca3946.jpg"/>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 65: Scottish Payet (GW22-23)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>It feels like things this season are finally starting to heat up, which makes it hard to believe that we have just 16 game weeks left. (Yeah, we suppose 16 weeks is still quite a ways to go.) Josh and Brandon take a moment to evaluate midseason strategies and how to assess your longterm goals for mini leagues and overall rank. We also discuss must-have midfielders, appealing third strikers, and recent moves in the January transfer window. And then we preview clean sheets, captains, and key players for GW23. Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
