		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 60: That's Okaka (GW15-17)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>After a week away from the FPL fold, the Always Cheating hosts return to recap the events of GW15. With the next two game weeks coming in quick succession, we're previewing both GW16 and GW17 in this one episode. Skip to 0:29:55 for GW16 predictions, clean sheets, and captain picks. For our GW17 preview, skip to 0:57:45. Also, listen up in this episode for a special opportunity to be a part of the Always Cheating community in a whole new way. Hail Cheaters.</p>
