			<pubDate>Tue, 27 Sep 2016 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<enclosure url="https://anchor.fm/s/10622ff04/podcast/play/104097837/https%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fstaging%2F2025-5-13%2F402121656-44100-2-16fa4eba82d98c6b.mp3" length="81277618" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;Injuries, disappointments, and disappearing clean sheets. #GW6 presented some challenges for our #FPL squads, but Always Cheating hosts Josh and Brandon are determined to find the fun within this season&apos;s fiascos. First off, we look at the underlying Opta stats for the Liverpool and Arsenal midfielders (both teams with a run of enticing fixtures) and pick the best of the bunch. Then it&apos;s a discussion of how best to spend in your defense, choosing between budget and premium options. And finally we try to put sell-by dates on some of this week&apos;s flops: Zlatan to Hazard, Lamela to Payet. Plus a #GW7 preview and your listener questions. Hail Cheaters!&lt;/p&gt;
