		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 45: Vocal Folks for Vokes (GW2-3)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Always Cheating co-hosts Josh and Brandon reunite (after Brandon's brief stint abroad) to recap the happenings in GW2 of the #FPL. Looking ahead, this episode's key topics focus on Everton's promising fixtures, midfielder must-haves versus differentials, and the best options for your cheap third striker—which, of course, means that we are advocating strongly for the Aguero and Ibrahimovic combo. We also field your listener questions and highlight some of the crucial fixtures for success in GW3. Hail Cheaters!</p>
