		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 43: Team Talk, Man United to West Ham (2016/17 Preview, Part 4)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Our preview of the 2016/17 #FPL season closes out with part two of our team-by-team Premier League analysis. Last week it was Arsenal through Manchester City, and in this episode we break down Manchester United, Middlesbrough, Southampton, Stoke City, Sunderland, Swansea, Tottenham, Watford, West Brom, and West Ham. Hosts Josh and Brandon look at new players, old favorites, sleeper picks, and opening fixture strengths and weaknesses. Plus we take one final moment to answer some listener questions before heading into this weekend's opening round. Good luck this season and Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
