		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 42: Team Talk, Arsenal to Man City (2016/17 Preview, Part 3)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Our preview of the 2016/17 #FPL season continues in this episode, the first of a two-part series discussing the prospects of all twenty Premier League clubs. Starting at the top of the alphabet, this week we tackle Arsenal, Bournemouth, Burnley, Chelsea, Crystal Palace, Everton, Hull City, Leicester City, Liverpool, and Manchester City. From new players, new prices, and pre-season form to our sleeper picks and opening fixture assessments, there's arguably too much for hosts Josh and Brandon to talk about. Plus we even take some listener questions! Stay tuned next week for a rundown of the remaining ten teams—subscribe on iTunes or wherever you get your podcasts. Hail Cheaters!</p>
