		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 41: Ten Tips for FPL Success (2016/17 Preview, Part 2)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>When is the best time to make a weekly transfer? Is it smarter to follow a player's form or fixtures? What is the optimal price distribution for your midfield? In a first for the Always Cheaters, we discuss ten tips for Fantasy Premier League (FPL) success and how to not lose your mind over the course of 38 grueling game weeks. From the risks and rewards of groupthink, to the necessity of keeping a cool head when things just aren't going your way, Josh and Brandon will help you start your FPL season on the right foot. Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
