		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 39: Championship Charlie (2015/16 Season Recap)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The truly remarkable and often painful 2015/2016 #FPL season is finally over. Brandon and Josh take a look back at what worked and what didn't. Were the new chips worth it? Did Chris Smalling spoil your party? What would you have done differently? Thanks to everyone who has listened to Always Cheating this season and we'll see you back here in August to preview the next. Hail Cheaters!</p>
