		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 38: Infinite Mbokani (GW37-38)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Having endured 37 weeks of madness, can the Always Cheating hosts keep it together for one last stand in #GW38? Brandon and Josh discuss what's left to compete for, who's left to compete for it, and  how influential a role Dieumerci Mbokani will play. (Spoiler alert: For Mbokani, there are no small parts.) We take your listener questions along the way. Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
