		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 37: Plato's Cave (GW36-37)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Leicester City have finally clinched the title, but how many #FPL mini leagues are still up for grabs? The Always Cheating hosts are here to help you see the season through, most crucially heading into the doubles of #GW37. Captains? Triple captains? Quadruple captains? Brandon and Josh sort out the best transfer options from Chelsea, West Ham, Manchester United, and the like, and respond to your listener questions. Hail Cheaters.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
