		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 36: A Hologram for Joshua King (GW35-36)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>With three weeks to go in this FPL season, is there anything left to play for? From glory to pride to cash, Brandon and Josh find plenty to urge managers on into GW36. The Always Cheating hosts discuss the hot topics and myriad suspensions that stemmed from GW35 and how to plan accordingly (must-haves, punts, Hail Marys) for the final strategic gambit of GW37. Hail Cheaters.</p>
