		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 35: It's a Trap! (GW34-35)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Checking in midway through the bloodbath that is #GW34, the Always Cheating hosts examine the outcomes of triple captains, bench boosts, and those brave enough to stick with their Spurs lineup. Has squad rotation hurt you? Has Agüero helped you? And will Alexis swoop in and save the day? We take listener questions and complaints as we head into the final flurry of midweek matches, followed by #GW35. Hail Cheaters.</p>
