		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 33: Shopping Spree (GW32-33)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>With so many wildcards now activated (including Josh's and Brandon's), this week's episode is less a recap of #GW32 and more a list of thing's we've learned and need to know going into the big #GW34 and #GW37 doubles. We talk about keeper rotations, triple captain choices, and who might get to stay in our squads from Spurs and Leicester City. For good measure, we judge the double for Everton and Crystal in #GW33 and respond to your listener questions. Hail Cheaters!</p>
