		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 31: Gonna Make You Sweat (GW30-31)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Always Cheating hosts discuss going to bed with Kane and waking up with Agüero and other bizarre #FPL decisions associated with the lean but rewarding #GW30. Speaking of, where do we currently stand with the underperforming Argentinian striker? And which attacker might make way for Lukaku or other differentials as we head into a sea of double game weeks? Plus we answer your listener questions and prep for #GW31 in the patented Optimizer. Hail Cheaters.</p>
