		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 30: El Nino (GW29-30)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>From the North London Derby to a continued Swansea renaissance, Brandon and Josh recap the rare blockbuster #FPL point haul that was #GW29. And then it's time to prepare for the lean, blank-filled weekend of #GW30: We discuss potential Manchester City defender and midfielder options, how to focus our Spurs game plan, and selecting the right captain between Aguero, Kane, and Vardy. Hail Cheaters!</p>
