		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 29: On the Aisle (GW27-29)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>After two wild game weeks, the #FPL deck seems to be reshuffled, but has anything really changed? From goalkeepers and defenders to the almighty need for a midfield differential, the Always Cheating hosts look at which players to buy or sell as the blanks of GW30 loom large. We take your listener questions and then optimize our squads for #GW29. Hail Cheaters.</p>
