		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 28: Emo Pellegrini (Break-GW27)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>It's time to unveil the exciting results of the Always Cheating 2/3 Season Awards—from the most valuable #FPL asset, to the least, and from the most underrated player to the one most likely to mount a comeback in the final third of the season. We've also surveyed how many of you have yet to play your chips, who you think is sure to be relegated, and which Premier League manager is likely to ruin the rest of your season. Plus your listener questions and a preview of #GW27. Hail Cheaters.</p>
