		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 27: In Hot Water (GW26-Break)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>From Özil's assist to Agüero's blank, we recap all of the major #FPL happenings from the action-packed #GW26. And as we head into an FA Cup break, the discussion turns heavily to differentials and how managers can beat the template and climb the ranks in this season's home stretch. We're also preparing our 2/3-season online poll for listeners to vote on the major hits and misses through the first 26 weeks. Follow us online for more details. Hail Cheaters.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
