		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 26: Continental Breakfast (GW25-26)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Always Cheating hosts revisit the infamous "Huth Game" and Leicester's complete annihilation of Manchester City, along with the other major events of #GW25. And still more blockbuster fixtures are to come in #GW26, so we discuss how to set up our #FPL squads ahead of the two top-four showdowns. Along with your listener questions, we cover Chelsea and Southampton defenses, midfield rotations, and a possibly ascendant Manchester United team. Hail Cheaters.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
