			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;The Always Cheating hosts revisit the infamous &quot;Huth Game&quot; and Leicester&apos;s complete annihilation of Manchester City, along with the other major events of #GW25. And still more blockbuster fixtures are to come in #GW26, so we discuss how to set up our #FPL squads ahead of the two top-four showdowns. Along with your listener questions, we cover Chelsea and Southampton defenses, midfield rotations, and a possibly ascendant Manchester United team. Hail Cheaters.&lt;/p&gt;
