		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 24: November Rain (GW23-24)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Always Cheating hosts put Game Week 23 into perspective and give what may be their final thoughts on the greatest guitar soloist in the entire FPL. From there, they discuss midfield replacements for an injured Kevin De Bruyne, the predictably swooning Arsenal, surging defenses, and fixture blanks ahead in Game Week 27. And then it's time to optimize for Game Week 24 and our first-ever "dirty watch." Hail Cheaters.</p>
