		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 23: School for the Blind (GW22-23)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Heading into Game Week 23, the Always Cheating hosts hail the Return of the Heavy Hitters! Brandon and Josh rank the current luxury-priced FPL strikers in light of recent attention-getting performances from Agüero, Rooney, Kane, Costa, and Giroud. There's also a lot of debate over Liverpool assets, affordable defenders, and the demise of FPL folk hero Riyad Mahrez. Poku Forever!</p>
