		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 21: Multiplicity (Festive Period)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Always Cheating hosts recap all (or most) of the events from the recent festive period featuring three weird and wild game weeks. Is Leicester City really falling away for good? Has Dimitri Payet been resurrected? Does one headed goal against Watford now make Agüero a must-own? And where does Chelsea's pummeling of Crystal Palace factor into the rest of these knee-jerk reactions? We cover these issues along with your listener questions. Happy New Year, Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
