		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 20: Allan-Romeo (GW17-Festive Period)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Always Cheating dives headlong into the Festive Period fixtures with our first-ever guide to surviving the FPL holidays. The hosts look to pack your squad's bench with budget performers likely to play 270 minutes and they formulate an armchair strategy of rotation risks, likely defenders, and who to sensibly captain from Game Week 18 through Game Week 20.</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
