		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 18: The Great Pumpkin (GW15-16)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Fire up the Stoke City bandwagon as Game Week 15 made complete converts of the Always Cheating hosts. But which Potter will best fit your FPL needs? And what have we learned, if anything, from Sunday's oddball fixture at St. James' Park? Optimizing for Game Week 16, Brandon and Josh discuss where to go with Liverpool assets, how to reset our thinking with Hazard, and juggling Leicester, Everton, and Spurs.</p>
