		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Ep 17: Eye Water (GW14-15)]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The head-to-head rivalry between Brandon and Josh is really starting to hit its boiling point, so who was the one left wounded after Game Week 14? Speaking of wounded, we discuss who will replace Alexis Sanchez—and, yeah, we're looking at options beyond Özil and De Bruyne. Optimizing for Game Week 15, how much more juice is left in this Watford attack? Will your Everton clean sheets finally come good? Is Josh joking about Chelsea's prospects? And how close is Vardy to evolving into a beam of pure, clean energy? Hail Cheaters!</p>
<p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>
]]></description>
