		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Always Cheating: Episode 4]]></title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Wildcard action abounds in game week 3 as Brandon and Josh run through what worked or didn't work in their revamped FPL squads. We go bandwagon jumping with Riyad Mahrez and various Manchester City assets, take a detour into mascot controversy, and look ahead to the game week 4 fixture list.</p>
