			<itunes:summary>&lt;p&gt;Wildcard action abounds in game week 3 as Brandon and Josh run through what worked or didn&apos;t work in their revamped FPL squads. We go bandwagon jumping with Riyad Mahrez and various Manchester City assets, take a detour into mascot controversy, and look ahead to the game week 4 fixture list.&lt;/p&gt;
